    "comment_data": [
        {
            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "This behavior is [by design](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/e24ec1fcf885990fec1a993fe8304a033fd1806d/doc/mini-clue.txt#L79-L82). As suggested in the help, use [`MiniClue.set_mapping_desc()`](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/e24ec1fcf885990fec1a993fe8304a033fd1806d/doc/mini-clue.txt#L624) to override description of existing mapping.\r\n\r\nClosing as not planned.",
